{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"741771055840100422","content":"A note is left in the town hall by some spiders:\n```I wish to testify against the banning of necromancy. I know that necromancy  is not inherently evil, and believe that it is possible to raise the dead without inherent consequences so long as the hags had no relation to the living that are raised. -Web```","created_at":"2020-08-11T04:39:38.994000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742603112816050257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
